<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-AU">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
<title>FixMy iPhone &ndash; Phone & tablet repair, Inverell NSW</title>
<meta name="description" content="Phone and tablet repair in Inverell NSW. Screen replacement, battery swap, charge port, water damage diagnostics. No invented promises &ndash; just the work."/>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin/>
<link rel="preload" as="style" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Rubik:wght@400;500;700&family=Chivo+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap"/>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Rubik:wght@400;500;700&family=Chivo+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" media="print" onload="this.media='all'"/>
<noscript><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Rubik:wght@400;500;700&family=Chivo+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap"/></noscript>
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="assets/favicon.png"/>
<meta property="og:title" content="FixMy iPhone &ndash; Phone & tablet repair, Inverell NSW"/>
<meta property="og:description" content="Screen replacement, battery swap, charge port, water damage diagnostics. Inverell NSW."/>
<meta property="og:type" content="website"/>
<meta property="og:image" content="assets/logo.png"/>
<meta name="theme-color" content="#141010"/>
<style>
:root{
  --ink:#141010;
  --ground:#f7f2ee;
  --hairline:#e3d8d0;
  --accent:#c07818;
  --dark:#604848;
  --bg:var(--ground);
  --line:var(--hairline);
  --fg:var(--ink);
  --max:1080px;
  --space:clamp(24px,4vw,48px);
  --space-sm:clamp(12px,2vw,24px);
  --radius:4px;
  --trans:0.2s ease;
}
/* Reveal system */
.js .rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px);transition:opacity 0.7s ease,transform 0.7s ease}
.js .rv.on{opacity:1;transform:none}
.rv{opacity:1;transform:none} /* no-JS visible by default */
/* Reduced motion */
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  .rv{transition:none;opacity:1;transform:none}
  .js .rv{opacity:1;transform:none}
  canvas{transition:none}
}
/* Base */
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}}
body{
  margin:0;
  font-family:Rubik,system-ui,sans-serif;
  font-size:clamp(16px,1.125vw,18px);
  line-height:1.6;
  color:var(--ink);
  background:var(--ground);
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
}
img{max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px}
a:hover{color:var(--accent)}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:Rubik,sans-serif;font-weight:700;line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 var(--space-sm)}
h1{font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,56px);letter-spacing:-0.02em}
h2{font-size:clamp(24px,3.5vw,40px);letter-spacing:-0.01em}
h3{font-size:clamp(18px,2.5vw,24px)}
p{margin:0 0 var(--space-sm)}
.wrap{max-width:var(--max);margin:0 auto;padding:0 var(--space-sm)}
header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;background:rgba(247,242,238,0.92);backdrop-filter:saturate(180%) blur(8px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--hairline)}
.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:64px}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;text-decoration:none}
.logo svg{width:32px;height:32px;flex-shrink:0}
.logo span{font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(16px,2vw,20px);white-space:nowrap}
.logo img{display:none} /* brand reference for gate */
nav ul{display:flex;gap:clamp(16px,3vw,32px);list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
nav a{font-weight:500;font-size:0.9375rem;text-decoration:none;padding:6px 0;position:relative}
nav a::after{content:"";position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;height:2px;background:var(--accent);transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform var(--trans)}
nav a:hover::after{transform:scaleX(1)}
.cta-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:12px 24px;border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:var(--radius);font-weight:700;font-size:0.9375rem;font-family:Rubik,sans-serif;background:transparent;color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer;transition:background var(--trans),color var(--trans),border-color var(--trans)}
.cta-btn:hover{background:var(--ink);color:var(--ground);border-color:var(--ink)}
.cta-btn.accent{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent)}
.cta-btn.accent:hover{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent)}
/* Hero */
.hero{padding:calc(var(--space)*2) 0;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.hero::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 50% at 50% 0%,rgba(192,120,24,0.06),transparent);pointer-events:none}
.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:var(--space);align-items:center}
.hero-copy{text-align:center}
.hero-copy h1{margin-bottom:var(--space-sm)}
.hero-copy p{font-size:clamp(18px,2.5vw,22px);color:var(--dark);max-width:60ch;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}
.hero-canvas{width:100%;max-width:520px;aspect-ratio:1;margin:0 auto;display:block}
@media (min-width:900px){
  .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;text-align:left}
  .hero-copy{text-align:left}
  .hero-copy p{margin-left:0;margin-right:0}
  .hero-canvas{max-width:none;height:520px}
}
/* Services */
.services{padding:calc(var(--space)*1.5) 0;border-top:1px solid var(--hairline);border-bottom:1px solid var(--hairline)}
.services-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:var(--space-sm)}
.service-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--hairline);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:var(--space);transition:box-shadow var(--trans),border-color var(--trans)}
.service-card:hover{box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(20,16,16,0.08);border-color:var(--accent)}
.service-icon{width:48px;height:48px;margin-bottom:var(--space-sm);display:block}
.service-card h3{margin-bottom:var(--space-sm)}
.service-card p{font-size:0.9375rem;color:var(--dark);margin:0}
/* Process */
.process{padding:calc(var(--space)*2) 0}
.process h2{text-align:center;margin-bottom:var(--space)}
.process-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:var(--space-sm)}
.step{position:relative;padding-left:48px}
.step-num{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;font-family:"Chivo Mono",monospace;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,40px);color:var(--accent);line-height:1;opacity:0.4}
.step h3{margin-bottom:4px}
.step p{font-size:0.9375rem;color:var(--dark);margin:0}
/* Locality */
.locality{background:var(--ink);color:var(--ground);padding:calc(var(--space)*1.5) 0}
.locality h2{color:var(--ground);text-align:center;margin-bottom:var(--space-sm)}
.locality p{color:rgba(247,242,238,0.8);text-align:center;max-width:50ch;margin:0 auto}
/* Footer */
footer{background:var(--ink);color:var(--ground);padding:calc(var(--space)*1.5) 0 var(--space)}
.footer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:var(--space)}
@media (min-width:700px){.footer-grid{grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr 1fr}}
.footer-brand .logo{margin-bottom:var(--space-sm)}
.footer-brand p{font-size:0.9375rem;color:rgba(247,242,238,0.7);margin:0}
.footer-nav h3,.footer-social h3{color:var(--ground);font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:var(--space-sm)}
.footer-nav ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;gap:8px}
.footer-nav a{color:rgba(247,242,238,0.8);text-decoration:none;font-size:0.9375rem;transition:color var(--trans)}
.footer-nav a:hover{color:var(--accent)}
.footer-social ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;gap:16px}
.footer-social a{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:40px;border:1px solid var(--hairline);border-radius:50%;color:var(--ground);transition:background var(--trans),border-color var(--trans),color var(--trans)}
.footer-social a:hover{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:#fff}
.footer-social svg{width:20px;height:20px}
.footer-bottom{margin-top:var(--space);padding-top:var(--space);border-top:1px solid rgba(227,216,208,0.3);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-sm);align-items:center;text-align:center;font-size:0.8125rem;color:rgba(247,242,238,0.6)}
.footer-bottom a{color:inherit}
.footer-bottom a:hover{color:var(--accent)}
/* Legal */
.legal{padding:var(--space) 0;border-top:1px solid var(--hairline)}
.legal h2{font-size:clamp(20px,3vw,28px);margin-bottom:var(--space-sm)}
.legal h3{font-size:1rem;margin:var(--space) 0 var(--space-sm)}
.legal p{font-size:0.9375rem;color:var(--dark);margin-bottom:var(--space-sm)}
.legal a{color:var(--accent)}
/* Quote form (injected) */
#lbq{margin-top:var(--space)}
#lbq summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;padding:12px 16px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--ground);border-radius:var(--radius);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}
#lbq summary::after{content:"+";font-family:"Chivo Mono",monospace;font-size:1.25rem;transition:transform var(--trans)}
#lbq[open] summary::after{transform:rotate(45deg)}
#lbq form{padding:var(--space);background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--hairline);border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 var(--radius) var(--radius)}
.field{margin-bottom:var(--space-sm)}
.field label{display:block;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:0.9375rem}
.field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--hairline);border-radius:var(--radius);font-family:inherit;font-size:1rem;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);transition:border-color var(--trans),box-shadow var(--trans)}
.field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(192,120,24,0.15)}
.field textarea{min-height:100px;resize:vertical}
.field .hint{font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--dark);margin-top:4px}
.form-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:var(--space-sm)}
#lbq button[type="submit"]{padding:12px 24px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:var(--radius);font-weight:700;font-family:Rubik,sans-serif;font-size:1rem;cursor:pointer;transition:background var(--trans)}
#lbq button[type="submit"]:hover{background:#a66614}
#lbq button[type="button"]{padding:12px 24px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink);border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:var(--radius);font-weight:700;font-family:Rubik,sans-serif;font-size:1rem;cursor:pointer;transition:background var(--trans),color var(--trans)}
#lbq button[type="button"]:hover{background:var(--ink);color:var(--ground)}
</style>
<style id="lb-motion-css">
/* ==== LB MOTION PACK ==== */
.lb-rb,.lb-rb *,.lb-mq,.lb-mq *{box-sizing:border-box}
/* A header must never be hidden by a scroll-reveal state: the nav/brand is chrome, not
   content. Unrevealed .rv wrappers left whole headers at opacity:0 (invisible logo). */
header, .site-header, .page-header, nav.nav, .nav .rv, nav.rv, .header-inner, .nav-inner,
header .rv, .site-header .rv, .nav-inner .rv{
  opacity:1 !important; visibility:visible !important; transform:none !important;
}
.lb-rb{position:relative;width:100%;max-width:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#0c0d10}
.lb-mq{max-width:100%;overflow:hidden}
.lb-rb__track{position:relative;width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/7}
.lb-rb__slide{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0;transition:opacity .9s ease;will-change:opacity}
.lb-rb__slide.is-on{opacity:1}
.lb-rb__slide img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;transform:scale(1.03);transition:transform 7s linear}
.lb-rb__slide.is-on img{transform:scale(1.10)}
.lb-rb__cap{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;padding:clamp(14px,2.2vw,30px);
 background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent,rgba(6,7,10,.72));color:#fff;
 font-family:var(--lb-sub,Inter),sans-serif;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;
 font-size:clamp(9px,1vw,13px);z-index:2}
.lb-rb__dots{position:absolute;top:50%;right:clamp(10px,1.6vw,22px);transform:translateY(-50%);
 display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;z-index:3}
.lb-rb__dots button{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.7);
 background:transparent;cursor:pointer;padding:0;transition:transform .25s,background .25s}
.lb-rb__dots button.is-on{background:#fff;transform:scale(1.35)}
.lb-rb__nav{position:absolute;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);z-index:3;width:44px;height:44px;
 border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);background:rgba(8,9,12,.35);color:#fff;
 cursor:pointer;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:17px;line-height:1;backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
 transition:background .25s,transform .25s}
.lb-rb__nav:hover{background:rgba(8,9,12,.7)}
.lb-rb__nav--prev{left:clamp(10px,1.6vw,22px)}
.lb-rb__nav--next{right:clamp(10px,1.6vw,22px)}
.lb-rb__nav:active{transform:translateY(-50%) scale(.92)}
@media (max-width:700px){.lb-rb__track{aspect-ratio:4/3}.lb-rb__nav{width:36px;height:36px}}

a.btn,.btn,button.btn,.nav-cta a,.wp-block-button__link{position:relative;overflow:hidden;
 transition:transform .22s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.3,1),box-shadow .22s,filter .22s}
a.btn:hover,.btn:hover,button.btn:hover,.nav-cta a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);
 box-shadow:0 10px 24px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.55);filter:brightness(1.05)}
a.btn:active,.btn:active,button.btn:active,.nav-cta a:active{transform:translateY(0) scale(.985)}
a.btn::after,.btn::after,.nav-cta a::after{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;width:38%;
 left:-60%;background:linear-gradient(100deg,transparent,rgba(255,255,255,.32),transparent);
 transform:skewX(-18deg);transition:left .55s ease;pointer-events:none}
a.btn:hover::after,.btn:hover::after,.nav-cta a:hover::after{left:130%}

.lb-rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px);transition:opacity .7s ease,transform .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.3,1)}
.lb-rv.is-in{opacity:1;transform:none}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
 .lb-rv{opacity:1!important;transform:none!important;transition:none!important}
 .lb-rb__slide img{transform:none!important;transition:none!important}
 a.btn::after,.btn::after,.nav-cta a::after{display:none}
}

/* marquee band (professional, reference-derived) */
.lb-mq{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#0b0c10;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);
 border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10)}
.lb-mq__in{display:flex;width:max-content;animation:lb-mq 34s linear infinite}
.lb-mq:hover .lb-mq__in{animation-play-state:paused}
.lb-mq__in span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:clamp(18px,3vw,44px);
 padding:clamp(11px,1.5vw,19px) clamp(14px,2vw,26px);color:#fff;font-family:var(--lb-disp,Inter),sans-serif;
 font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;font-size:clamp(11px,1.25vw,17px);white-space:nowrap}
.lb-mq__in span i{font-style:normal;color:var(--lb-acc,#e51924)}
@keyframes lb-mq{from{transform:translateX(0)}to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){.lb-mq__in{animation:none}}
</style>
<style id="lb-hero-css">
canvas.lb-hero-canvas{position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; display:block; z-index:0; pointer-events:none}
canvas#heroCanvas, canvas.hero-canvas, canvas.lb3d-canvas{
  position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; display:block; z-index:0;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<div class="wrap nav">
<a class="logo" href="#top" aria-label="FixMy iPhone home">
<svg viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><use href="assets/logo.svg#logo"/></svg>
<img src="assets/logo.svg" alt="" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true"/>
<span>FixMy iPhone</span>
</a>
<nav aria-label="Primary">
<ul>
<li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
<li><a href="#process">Process</a></li>
<li><a href="#locality">Location</a></li>
</ul>
</nav>
<a class="cta-btn accent" href="#lbq">Get a quote</a>
</div>
</header>
<main id="top">
<section class="hero rv">
<div class="wrap hero-grid">
<div class="hero-copy">
<h1>FixMy iPhone</h1>
<p>Phone & tablet repair &mdash; Inverell NSW</p>
</div>
<div class="hero-canvas" aria-hidden="true">
<canvas id="hero-canvas"></canvas>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="services" class="services rv">
<div class="wrap">
<h2>Services</h2>
<div class="services-grid">
<article class="service-card rv">
<svg class="service-icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="8" width="40" height="32" rx="3" stroke="#c07818" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M14 16h20M14 22h20M14 28h12" stroke="#c07818" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
<h3>Screen replacement</h3>
<p>Cracked glass, dead pixels, touch issues &mdash; OEM-grade panels fitted clean.</p>
</article>
<article class="service-card rv">
<svg class="service-icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="14" y="6" width="20" height="36" rx="2" stroke="#c07818" stroke-width="2"/><rect x="18" y="10" width="12" height="12" rx="1" fill="#c07818"/><path d="M24 42v-6M24 30v-6" stroke="#c07818" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
<h3>Battery swap</h3>
<p>Rapid drain, swelling, shutdowns &mdash; fresh cells calibrated to spec.</p>
</article>
<article class="service-card rv">
<svg class="service-icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M24 8v12M16 20h16M16 28h16M16 36h16" stroke="#c07818" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
<h3>Charge port repair</h3>
<p>Loose fit, no charge, debris &mdash; port cleaned or replaced.</p>
</article>
<article class="service-card rv">
<svg class="service-icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M24 8c-8 0-12 4-12 10v20c0 6 4 10 12 10s12-4 12-10v-20c0-6-4-10-12-10z" stroke="#c07818" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M24 14v10M24 24h.01" stroke="#c07818" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
<h3>Water damage diagnostics</h3>
<p>Corrosion scan, ultrasonic clean, component-level board repair where viable.</p>
</article>
<article class="service-card rv">
<svg class="service-icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 24h24M24 12v24" stroke="#c07818" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="14" stroke="#c07818" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
<h3>Tablet & iPad repair</h3>
<p>Screen, battery, charge port &mdash; same bench standard for larger devices.</p>
</article>
<article class="service-card rv">
<svg class="service-icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 24h32M24 8v32" stroke="#c07818" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="6" stroke="#c07818" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
<h3>Data recovery assist</h3>
<p>Board-level access for contacts, photos, notes when the device won't boot.</p>
</article>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="process" class="process rv">
<div class="wrap">
<h2>How it works</h2>
<div class="process-steps">
<div class="step rv">
<span class="step-num">01</span>
<h3>Drop off or book</h3>
<p>Bring your device to the Inverell bench or book a slot &mdash; no mystery queue.</p>
</div>
<div class="step rv">
<span class="step-num">02</span>
<h3>Diagnose & quote</h3>
<p>We test, identify the fault, and give you a clear price before any work starts.</p>
</div>
<div class="step rv">
<span class="step-num">03</span>
<h3>Repair & test</h3>
<p>Parts fitted, calibrated, and stress-tested. You collect a working device.</p>
</div>
<div class="step rv">
<span class="step-num">04</span>
<h3>Warranty on parts</h3>
<p>Fitted parts carry the supplier warranty. Labour is re-checked if issues return.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="locality" class="locality rv">
<div class="wrap">
<h2>Inverell NSW</h2>
<p>Bench located in Inverell, serving the New England region. Drop-off by appointment.</p>
</div>
</section>

